*.pyc
__pycache__/
*.onnx
*.bin
logs/

# Avatar models. Kept out of the repo on licence grounds, not size: VRoid Hub
# models are commonly published with redistribution disallowed, and this repo
# is public. See static/models/README.md.
static/models/*.glb
static/models/*.vrm

# PyInstaller build artifacts
build/
dist/
out/

static/models/*

# RVC voice-conversion workspace: the Applio checkout, its venv, trained
# weights, and the ElevenLabs-generated training audio. Large, and the
# training clips are third-party TTS output -- this repo is public.
RVC/

# Model weights (RVC checkpoints are 400MB-900MB each). Alongside *.onnx/*.bin
# above -- none of these belong in a public repo.
*.pth

# Archived training runs. lux_rvc.zip is 1.9GB: the D_/G_ resume checkpoints
# plus every epoch snapshot. Only the final weights and lux.index are needed at
# inference, and those ship as GitHub Release assets, not in the repo.
*_rvc.zip
lux.index